1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,813
{\an8}SKERRY POINT LIGHTHOUSE

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:07,213
- Marta. The lamp is out.
- The lamp is not out.

3
00:00:07,613 --> 00:00:10,238
It is dark, Marta. That is what out means.

4
00:00:10,638 --> 00:00:12,638
- It is resting.
- It is a lamp.

5
00:00:13,038 --> 00:00:14,850
Everything rests. Even lamps.

6
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,750
<i>She did not look up from her tea.</i>

7
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:21,400
- Ivo, in eleven weeks
you have not once been right.

8
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,550
I was right about the gulls.

9
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:26,575
You said there were four. There were nine.

10
00:00:26,975 --> 00:00:29,287
Four of them were the important ones.

11
00:00:29,687 --> 00:00:33,312
- Go and look at the lamp.
- I am looking at it from here.

12
00:00:33,712 --> 00:00:35,212
From here it looks fine.

13
00:00:35,612 --> 00:00:36,812
It is off.

14
00:00:37,212 --> 00:00:38,587
It looks fine and off.

15
00:00:38,987 --> 00:00:40,675
<i>A long, wet silence.</i>

16
00:00:41,075 --> 00:00:43,325
If a ship comes now, what do we say?

17
00:00:43,725 --> 00:00:45,475
We say the lamp was resting.

18
00:00:45,875 --> 00:00:48,375
- They will write that down.
- Let them.

19
00:00:48,775 --> 00:00:50,400
They wrote down the gulls.

20
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,800
They wrote down four gulls, Ivo.

21
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,400
Nine.

22
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,425
- Fine. Nine.
- Thank you.

23
00:00:56,825 --> 00:01:00,137
<i>Marta climbs the stairs. Ninety-eight of them.</i>

24
00:01:00,537 --> 00:01:01,737
Ninety-eight!

25
00:01:02,137 --> 00:01:04,762
It is ninety-seven. You count the landing.

26
00:01:05,162 --> 00:01:06,600
The landing is a stair.

27
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,563
The landing is a landing.

28
00:01:08,963 --> 00:01:10,163
- Marta?
- What.

29
00:01:10,563 --> 00:01:11,763
Is it on?

30
00:01:12,163 --> 00:01:14,788
<i>A pause the length of a lighthouse.</i>

31
00:01:15,188 --> 00:01:16,388
It is on.

32
00:01:16,788 --> 00:01:18,663
- So it was resting.
- Do not.

33
00:01:19,063 --> 00:01:21,063
It was resting and now it is up.

34
00:01:21,463 --> 00:01:22,663
Ivo.

35
00:01:23,063 --> 00:01:24,750
Like a person. Like a gull.

36
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:26,650
Ivo, come and hold this.

37
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:28,363
{\an8}TWO HOURS LATER

38
00:01:28,763 --> 00:01:30,513
- Marta?
- Still holding it.

